// every OD, weight, resistance, inductance, ampacity and short-circuit figure is transcribed
// rather than typed - do not hand-edit, re-generate if a newer revision is issued.
//
//   N2XY  Cu / XLPE / PVC   0.6/1 kV   IEC 60502-1
//   1 core   1.5 - 800 mm2      2 core   1.5 - 300 mm2      3 core  1.5 - 300 mm2
//   4 core   1.5 - 300 mm2      5 core   1.5 - 50 mm2
//
// N2XY is the XLPE family this project's panel schedules actually specify. XLPE runs at a
// 90 degC conductor temperature against PVC's 70 degC, so an N2XY cable carries noticeably
// more current and is a little slimmer than the NYY of the same size - which is why matching
// an N2XY circuit onto an NYY entry understates its ampacity.
//
// Ampacities are catalogue values at 30 degC ambient and still need the grouping and ambient
// corrections in src/core/derating.ts.

